{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1350345600, "end_date": 1351036799, "month_true_total": 47, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:46:48 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "743517", "author": {"steamid": "76561197977137395", "personaname": "another dark knight", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197977137395/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 758, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 758, "last_played": 1353139200, "avatar": "90a06d5174d3e00a07b156346f6cd2c10147a923"}, "language": "english", "review": "Visually very cool and stylistic 3rd person shooter. Love switching between sniping orcs, to drilling them with sub machine gun, then switching to my poweraxe when they get too close. Oh, and the rocket pack with massive warhammer - pure fun!", "timestamp_created": 1351032014, "timestamp_updated": 1351032014, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2468599", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007812584", "personaname": "Hellbreaking", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198007812584/", "num_games_owned": 945, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3534, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2786, "last_played": 1671576824, "avatar": "af1cf9cf15be50bc6eda5a5c35bb1698bbf77ecd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Only Ash Remains", "timestamp_created": 1350976482, "timestamp_updated": 1350976482, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3894727", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028698981", "personaname": "Sentinel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sentinel205/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 7823, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4091, "last_played": 1731817545, "avatar": "b2f9f0e549c711421d48881705cb351553d89a85"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still a fantastic game, even unmodded.", "timestamp_created": 1350917359, "timestamp_updated": 1588398571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514066517353057861", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6124689", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059529979", "personaname": "Big Heart", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198059529979/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 492, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 492, "last_played": 1382291124, "avatar": "1f73da93e6a405f8010b1cb0359207965761eac1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Now, I'm certain that this will seem like fanboy gushing, but this game, is actually incredible. In my personal opinion, the audio to this game is probably the best part, the sounds of a bolter shell being chambered, orks screaming, and your chainsword revving are some of the most eargasmic noises concocted by man. Gushing aside, the class based multiplayer puts startling amount of thought into a simple game of team deathmatch, making a game into a tactical battle requiring small unit tactics to succeed. The main campaign being relatively simple, though jammed full of action and gratuitous violence in every orifice, is quite entertaining, though the multiplayer is where the game truly shines.\n\n7/10", "timestamp_created": 1350913107, "timestamp_updated": 1402687306, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1290547", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990791098", "personaname": "SysFin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SysFin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 769, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 769, "last_played": 1350802800, "avatar": "1ebfe21a80cdf96e3560192e8cc395ccab7cd478"}, "language": "english", "review": "A solid game.  Nothing super original, but it is well balanced.  A nice varity of weapons, and some enjoyable vehicle sections.  The jump pack sections were absolute fun.  The enemy varity was a little low but that is made up for by the sheer number of them. \nSidekick AI is good enough were you never feel like you babysitting and occasionally provides some cover fire.  It could be better though, I would like to have provided orders to cover my while I rush ahead or to focus fire on a key target.\n\nAlso for those that like the 40k universe (fluff) this game fairly solid, especially the charge to the spire in chapter 16.  Seeing a couple of other chapters other then the ultramarines was cool.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1350851661, "timestamp_updated": 1350851661, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}